data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Off-target risk missing:** The mechanism bullet omits off-target cutting, a central safety concern for Cas9 editing, and cites no source for it.\n- **Thin sourcing for origin claim:** The bacterial and archaeal origin rests on a single source, and the bullet doesn't explain how spacer storage works.\n- **Vague disease claims:** \"Treatment of many diseases\" names no conditions or trial stages. The bullet also asserts the sources lack detail without showing which claims they fail to support."}

